The MIT License does not grant any right to use the name “FinHavenArc” as a trademark or brand. You may use the name to say truthfully where the Software came from, but please do not use it in a way that suggests the Licensor endorses or is affiliated with you, your product, or your modified version. If you distribute a modified version, please make clear that it is modified and is not the official FinHavenArc Screener.

